## Architecture Rules

### Backend — Clean Architecture (MANDATORY)

Layers (inner → outer, no reverse imports):
```
domain/          → Entities, Value Objects, Aggregates (pure Go, no frameworks)
application/     → Use cases, orchestration
infrastructure/  → DB (GORM), Redis, MongoDB, external APIs
interfaces/api/  → Gin handlers, middleware, DTOs
```

**✅ Good:**
```go
// domain/note.go — pure domain entity
type Note struct {
    id      uuid.UUID
    title   string
    content string
}

func NewNote(title, content string) (*Note, error) {
    if title == "" {
        return nil, errors.New("title is required")
    }
    return &Note{id: uuid.New(), title: title, content: content}, nil
}
```

**❌ Bad — global variable:**
```go
var db *gorm.DB  // NEVER do this

// ✅ Good — dependency injection
type NoteRepository struct {
    db *gorm.DB
}
func NewNoteRepository(db *gorm.DB) *NoteRepository {
    return &NoteRepository{db: db}
}
```

**❌ Bad — panic in business logic:**
```go
func (r *NoteRepo) FindByID(id uuid.UUID) *Note {
    // NEVER panic — return error
    panic("not found")
}
// ✅ Good
func (r *NoteRepo) FindByID(id uuid.UUID) (*Note, error) {
    return note, fmt.Errorf("finding note %s: %w", id, err)
}
```

### Frontend — Svelte 5 Runes (MANDATORY)

**✅ Svelte 5 runes ONLY:**
```svelte
<script lang="ts">
    let count = $state(0);
    let doubled = $derived(count * 2);
    $effect(() => { console.log(count); });

    interface Props { title: string; }
    let { title }: Props = $props();
</script>
```

**❌ Svelte 4 — NEVER use:**
```svelte
<script>
    import { writable } from 'svelte/store'; // ❌ outdated
    const count = writable(0);               // ❌ use $state instead
</script>
```

**Frontend folders (FSD + Atomic Design):**
```
frontend/src/components/
├── atoms/          # Button, Input, Badge, Icon — single responsibility
├── molecules/      # NoteCard, SearchBar, TagList — composed atoms
└── organisms/      # GraphCanvas, NotePanel, Sidebar — complex sections
frontend/src/shared/
├── api/            # ky-based API clients
├── stores/         # runes-based state modules
├── services/       # business logic, preload, side effects
├── utils/          # helpers
├── types/          # TypeScript types
├── mocks/          # SvelteKit mocks for Vitest
