## Redis — go-redis/v9 API (CRITICAL)

**❌ v8 API (WRONG — will break):**
```go
redis.Options{ MaxConnAge: 30 * time.Minute, IdleTimeout: 5 * time.Minute }
```

**✅ v9 API (CORRECT):**
```go
redis.Options{
    ConnMaxLifetime: 30 * time.Minute,
    ConnMaxIdleTime: 5 * time.Minute,
}
```

