## Language Policy

**User-facing runtime content MUST be in English:**

```typescript
// ✅ Good
toast.success("Note created successfully");
placeholder="Search your knowledge graph..."
errorMessage = "Failed to load notes. Please try again."

// ❌ Bad
toast.success("Заметка создана успешно");
```

**Applies to:** UI strings, toast messages, tooltips (GalacticLexicon), note content, commit messages.
**May be bilingual:** Documentation (the authoritative English version must be present; Russian translations may be added alongside).
**Exceptions:** Internal code comments (any language OK).

